WEBVTT

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:01.367
Won't look down, won't open my eyes

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.953
Keep my glass full until morning light

00:02:03.953 --> 00:02:06.706
Because I'm just holding on for tonight

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:08.291
On for tonight

00:02:08.332 --> 00:02:09.458
Sun is up

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:14.130
Ryan Heffington: Now, let's play
that video one more time.

00:02:14.172 --> 00:02:16.465
And I want to show you
what inspired those moves.

00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:19.677
You may be surprised
at how rudimentary the sources are.

00:02:20.011 --> 00:02:21.762
(No music)

00:02:21.804 --> 00:02:24.473
RH: And fork, fork, fork,
stab it in the wall,

00:02:24.473 --> 00:02:26.184
toss it and pass out,

00:02:26.225 --> 00:02:27.393
come to

00:02:27.393 --> 00:02:28.561
and look;

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:31.272
Charlie Chaplin, Charlie Chaplin,
cockroach up the wall,